                        <p class="text-muted">Fine-grained roles: Super Admin, President, Owner, Tenant with least privilege.</p>
                        <ul class="small text-muted mb-0">
                            <li>ASP.NET Core Identity</li>
                            <li>Claims-based access</li>
                            <li>Audit-friendly patterns</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
